<h2>Measure in Halves of an Inch</h2>
<p>The 2021 student worksheet has THREE pages and no fixed measurement answers: Warm-up (what do you know about inches?), Activity 1.1 measuring actual objects, and Activity 1.2 marking and measuring half inches. This independent teaching display is not the publisher ruler/blackline artwork.</p>
<h3>1.1 Measure Around the Room — table for every pupil</h3><p>Work in pairs; each pupil chooses <strong>three real objects</strong>. Use a ruler with whole-inch ticks to record observed lengths. Align objects to the ZERO mark; explain any endpoints between whole-inch ticks.</p>
