<h3>1.2 Partition Inches into Halves — TWO original student directions</h3>
<ol><li>Keep one ruler marked in whole inches only. On the other ruler mark the midpoint of EVERY consecutive whole-inch interval.</li><li>Use your NEW half-inch ruler to measure three actual objects per pupil and record nearest half inch, including object name and value in inches.</li></ol>
