<h3>Source lesson synthesis</h3><p>Compare a ruler to a number line: both locate values and can be partitioned equally. Nine half-inch jumps is <strong>9/2 inches = 4 1/2 inches</strong>. The whole-plus-fraction name is a <em>mixed number</em>.</p><p>Teacher checks zero alignment, true halfway marks, measured objects, rounding, and explanations; no source-fixed object length or publisher Cool-down is claimed. <a href="https://im.kendallhunt.com/k5/teachers/grade-3/unit-6/lesson-1/lesson.html">2021 teacher lesson</a>.</p></section>